```
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.eggs/

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Output folders
Graphs/
Plotted Excel/

# Input data (optional — remove if you want to track data files)
*.xls
*.xlsx
```
